       DDPPKKGG__DDEEBB__TTHHRREEAADDSS__MMAAXX
           Sets the maximum number of threads allowed for compressors that
           support multi-threaded operations (since dpkg 1.21.9).

           The ----tthhrreeaaddss--mmaaxx option overrides this value.

       DDPPKKGG__DDEEBB__CCOOMMPPRREESSSSOORR__TTYYPPEE
           Sets the compressor type to use (since dpkg 1.21.10).

           The --ZZ option overrides this value.

